# THIS REPOSITORY HOLDS THE BUILT GAME ONLY -- never its source.
# Everything is ignored; only the web build's own file types are let through.
# (tools/release.sh in the source repository also refuses any other file
# before it pushes: a `git add -f` walks past this list.)
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!.nojekyll
!README.md
!index.html
!*.wasm
!*.pck
!*.js
!*.png
!*.ico
!*.svg
!*.webmanifest
!version.json
# Never, even inside a let-through folder:
*.gd
*.gdc
*.remap
*.tscn
*.tres
*.cfg
*.md
!README.md
